    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir45">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir45-Hd1e98">Caput 45</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir45-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir45-Hd1e102">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir45-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir45_6@5-5">Praecepta.</quote>
            In monte Sinai, scilicet legem dedit ei et praecepta vitae, cum eo loquens in nube.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir45-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir45-Hd1e113">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir45-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir45_9@1-2">Et circumcinxit eum,</quote>
            etc. Describit ritum veteris sacerdotii et ornatum pontificis, quae omnia figura erant Novi Testamenti, et veri sacerdotis Jesu Christi.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir45-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir45_9">Et induit.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Vestimenta pontificis sunt opera virtutum: sapientia, doctrina.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir45-Dd1e130">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir45-Hd1e132">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir45-d1e134">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e136" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir45_14@1-2">Corona aurea,</quote>
            etc. In qua erat nomen omnipotentis Dei, quae significat honorificentiam divinae majestatis, quoniam super omnia statuere debemus, ut in omnibus actibus nostris et sermonibus honorificetur Deus <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e139" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr4_11@21-25">per Jesum Christum, qui est caput nostrum</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir45-Dd1e144">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir45-Hd1e146">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir45-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir45_17@1-1">Sacrificia.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir45-Rd1e153"><name xml:id="gom-sir45-Nd1e154" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e157"><seg type="qs">Quomodo Moyses Aaron</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Christi enim sacerdotium et ritus sacrificiorum in aeternum manebit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir45-Dd1e167">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir45-Hd1e169">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir45-d1e171">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e173" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir45_28@2-4">Phinees filius Eleazari.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir45-Rd1e176"><name xml:id="gom-sir45-Nd1e177" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e180"><seg type="qs">Phinees, sicut scriptum est in libro Numerorum <!--<note>(Cap. XXV)</note>--></seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ad montem fortitudinis, id est Christum, <pb ed="#P" n="1227B"/> feliciter pervenit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir45-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir45-Hd1e194">Versus 31</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir45-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir45_31@1-3">Et testamentum David.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir45-Rd1e201"><name xml:id="gom-sir45-Nd1e202" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir45-Qd1e205"><seg type="qs">Significat quod David in distributione ministeriorum Dei</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et in tabernaculo ministrorum vices ordinavit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
